    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A time-traveling ancient style male protagonist interactive AVG, with multiple endings and multiple branches, a journey of bonding with six close friends in a parallel world to dominate the world. Will you be a wise leader respected by all people, or a tyrant that everyone fears? Will you stick your back to your brother, or will you stick your back to your brother twice? How will you choose among the four female protagonists? Under the collision of modern thinking and ancient thought, on the road to the highest power, full of thorns, is it a Spring and Autumn Dream, or...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Game content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200,000 words of plot content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 hours of game time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ background plot music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ exquisite CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All voice-overs except the protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient style group portrait story, diverse and full characters, bright colors, exquisite picture quality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple choices, multiple branches, multiple endings, non-single choice jump ending mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision will affect the final outcome of each character, choose carefully</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, there are ideological collisions of various schools of thought in the Spring and Autumn Period, and there are wonderful moments of playing chess with great scholars in parallel world history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes battle royale, spy war, comedy, dark, harem, warmth, affection, power, war, philosophy and other elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not stupid, all members are ruthless, without technology suppression, only relying on modern people's values, philosophical concepts, historical knowledge, culture and emotions and cognition engraved in the bones, counterattack all the way</p>",
